Package: peft-termux
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: pytorch-termux, transformers-termux, python-pip, rust, python-psutil, accelerate-termux
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: PEFT (Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning) for Termux
 LoRA and other parameter-efficient methods for fine-tuning
 HuggingFace models on a phone (CPU). apt installs torch, transformers
 (safetensors compiled with Rust), rust and psutil; the install step
 pip-installs accelerate and peft. Commands: peft-check, peft-setup.
 Set PEFT_SKIP_SETUP=1 during apt install to skip the setup (run
 peft-setup later).
